# Governance Assets

- Keep root `AGENTS.md` short and limited to stable invariants.
- Use focused `.mdc` rules with valid `description`, `globs` when path-specific, and `alwaysApply`.
- Keep agent roles narrow; mark exploration, impact analysis, debugging, and review read-only.
- Every agent uses the common task envelope and completion receipt.
- Keep `SKILL.md` concise. Put detailed workflow guidance in directly linked, one-level-deep references.
- Use repository-relative POSIX paths and technology-neutral language.
- Do not add executable skill scripts; invoke only `node scripts/harness.mjs ...` when a deterministic harness action is needed.
